;SHEET
THERE ARE SEVERAL BIFURCATED SHEETS IN THIS STRUCTURE.
THESE ARE REPRESENTED BY TWO SHEETS WHICH HAVE ONE OR MORE
IDENTICAL STRANDS.  SHEETS *S2A* AND *S2B* REPRESENT ONE
BIFURCATED SHEET.  SHEETS *S3A* AND *S3B* REPRESENT ONE
BIFURCATED SHEET.  SHEETS *S4A* AND *S4B* REPRESENT ONE
BIFURCATED SHEET.
